WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
What if your entire security operation could run from one connected platform? Meet DeepsGuard360, a cloud-based Security Management SaaS platform for Papua New Guinea and the Pacific.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Register a company, simulate email verification, create a private workspace, and select Starter for 50 guards, Growth for 150, Professional for 300, or custom Enterprise.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Company administrators see guards, staff on duty, sites, patrols, incidents, contracts, and performance in one dashboard.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Manage guard profiles and documents, then build rosters, assign shifts, track attendance, and review leave.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:58.000
The guard mobile app demonstrates duties, clock-in and out, simulated GPS status, patrols, checkpoints, incident reporting, control-room messages, and offline sync.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Monitor patrol routes and checkpoints on the map. Demo markers are fictional; MeshSat provides the live map of Papua New Guinea.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Review the simulated attempted break-in alert at Commercial Site A, assign a response, and view clearly simulated CCTV panels.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Track incident severity, notes, assignments, resolution, and history. Give clients restricted access to their own sites and reports.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Download reports and manage isolated company workspaces centrally. DeepsGuard360: One Platform. Complete Security Operations. Developed and powered by Deeps Systems.
